<title>USA: Heartstream names Gary Onn CFO.</title>
<headline>Heartstream names Gary Onn CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartstream Inc said Wednesday it appointed former director of finance and administration Gary Onn to the newly created position of vice president of finance and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Onn will be responsible for the overall management and direction of the company's finances and administrative functions, Heartstream said.</p>
<p>He served as the company's director of finance and administration since 1994.</p>
</text>
